{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ8aWdNzkk9tuGydBNww","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014tEDjoAStSdmgKY764Ckhp","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-005-NhAvxb/index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n  <title>暖爪社区宠物医院</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"暖爪社区宠物医院：内科、外科、牙科、影像、疫苗驱虫与美容护理，专业医生团队，电话预约。\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\">\n        <span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🐾</span>\n        暖爪社区宠物医院\n      </a>\n      <nav class=\"nav\" aria-label=\"主导航\">\n        <a href=\"#departments\">科室介绍</a>\n        <a href=\"#doctors\">医生团队</a>\n        <a href=\"#booking\">预约就诊</a>\n      </nav>\n      <a class=\"header-call\" href=\"tel:01088886666\">📞 010-8888-6666</a>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"top\">\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">就在你家楼下的宠物医院</span>\n          <h1>用心守护<br>每一个<em>毛孩子</em>的健康</h1>\n          <p>我们是扎根社区的综合性宠物医院，提供猫狗及小型异宠的日常诊疗、手术、疫苗与体检服务。离家近、看病快、医生熟悉，让你和它都更安心。</p>\n          <div class=\"actions\">\n            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#booking\">电话预约</a>\n            <a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"#departments\">了解科室</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <aside class=\"hero-card\" aria-label=\"营业时间\">\n          <h2>🕘 营业时间</h2>\n          <ul class=\"hours\">\n            <li><span>周一至周五</span><span>09:00 – 21:00</span></li>\n            <li><span>周六、周日</span><span>09:30 – 20:00</span></li>\n            <li><span>法定节假日</span><span>10:00 – 18:00</span></li>\n          </ul>\n          <div class=\"badge-emergency\">\n            <strong>🚑 夜间急诊：</strong>21:00 后请拨打预约电话，值班医生将第一时间回复。\n          </div>\n        </aside>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section alt\" id=\"departments\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <h2>科室介绍</h2>\n          <p>分科诊疗，各司其职，从日常小病到专科手术都能就近解决。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-3\">\n          <article class=\"dept\">\n            <div class=\"dept-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🩺</div>\n            <h3>内科</h3>\n            <p>呕吐腹泻、皮肤瘙痒、咳嗽感冒、泌尿问题等常见病的诊断与治疗，慢性病长期管理。</p>\n            <div class=\"tags\"><span>消化</span><span>皮肤</span><span>呼吸</span><span>慢病管理</span></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"dept\">\n            <div class=\"dept-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🔪</div>\n            <h3>外科</h3>\n            <p>绝育手术、外伤缝合、肿物切除、骨科手术，配备独立无菌手术室与吸入麻醉监护。</p>\n            <div class=\"tags\"><span>绝育</span><span>外伤</span><span>骨科</span><span>软组织</span></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"dept\">\n            <div class=\"dept-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🦷</div>\n            <h3>牙科</h3>\n            <p>超声波洗牙、口腔检查、拔牙及口炎治疗，帮助预防因牙病引起的全身性问题。</p>\n            <div class=\"tags\"><span>洗牙</span><span>拔牙</span><span>口炎</span></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"dept\">\n            <div class=\"dept-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🔬</div>\n            <h3>影像与检验</h3>\n            <p>数字 X 光、B 超、血常规、生化、尿检等检查，多数结果 30 分钟内出报告。</p>\n            <div class=\"tags\"><span>DR</span><span>B 超</span><span>血液检验</span></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"dept\">\n            <div class=\"dept-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">💉</div>\n            <h3>预防保健</h3>\n            <p>幼宠疫苗、狂犬疫苗、体内外驱虫、年度体检套餐，并为每只宠物建立健康档案。</p>\n            <div class=\"tags\"><span>疫苗</span><span>驱虫</span><span>体检</span></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"dept\">\n            <div class=\"dept-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🛁</div>\n            <h3>美容与住院</h3>\n            <p>洗护美容、药浴，以及术后住院与寄养观察，24 小时专人照护。</p>\n            <div class=\"tags\"><span>洗护</span><span>药浴</span><span>住院</span></div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"doctors\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <h2>医生团队</h2>\n          <p>执业兽医师团队，耐心沟通，把每只宠物当作自家孩子。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-4\">\n          <article class=\"doctor\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">林</div>\n            <h3>林医生</h3>\n            <p class=\"role\">院长 · 内科主治</p>\n            <p class=\"bio\">从业 15 年，擅长猫科慢性肾病、糖尿病等慢性病管理。</p>\n            <p class=\"time\">出诊：周一至周五</p>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"doctor\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">陈</div>\n            <h3>陈医生</h3>\n            <p class=\"role\">外科主治</p>\n            <p class=\"bio\">擅长软组织手术与骨科手术，完成绝育手术逾三千例。</p>\n            <p class=\"time\">出诊：周二至周六</p>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"doctor\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">周</div>\n            <h3>周医生</h3>\n            <p class=\"role\">牙科 · 皮肤科</p>\n            <p class=\"bio\">专注宠物口腔与皮肤病，对过敏性皮炎有丰富经验。</p>\n            <p class=\"time\">出诊：周三至周日</p>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"doctor\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">许</div>\n            <h3>许医生</h3>\n            <p class=\"role\">影像 · 异宠</p>\n            <p class=\"bio\">负责 B 超与 X 光诊断，兼看兔子、仓鼠等小型异宠。</p>\n            <p class=\"time\">出诊：周末及节假日</p>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section alt\" id=\"booking\">\n      <div class=\"wrap booking\">\n        <div class=\"phone-card\">\n          <h2>预约电话</h2>\n          <p>提前预约可减少等候时间，急症请直接来院或来电。</p>\n          <a class=\"phone-number\" href=\"tel:01088886666\" id=\"phone\">010-8888-6666</a>\n          <p class=\"sub\">接听时间：每日 09:00 – 21:00（夜间急诊同号）</p>\n          <button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"copyBtn\">复制号码</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"steps\">\n          <h3>预约流程</h3>\n          <ol>\n            <li><strong>来电预约：</strong>告知宠物种类、年龄和主要症状。</li>\n            <li><strong>确认时间：</strong>前台为您安排合适的科室与医生。</li>\n            <li><strong>按时到院：</strong>请携带既往病历和疫苗本（如有）。</li>\n            <li><strong>就诊复查：</strong>医生会告知复诊时间，并电话回访。</li>\n          </ol>\n          <div class=\"address\">\n            📍 地址：幸福里社区 3 号楼底商（社区北门东侧 50 米）<br>\n            🚗 门前可临时停车，猫咪请装入航空箱，狗狗请牵好牵引绳。\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <span>© 2026 暖爪社区宠物医院</span>\n      <span>动物诊疗许可证号：（请填写）</span>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <div class=\"mobile-call\">\n    <a href=\"tel:01088886666\">📞 一键拨打预约电话</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    document.getElementById('copyBtn').addEventListener('click', function () {\n      var btn = this;\n      var number = document.getElementById('phone').textContent.trim();\n      var done = function () {\n        btn.textContent = '已复制 ✓';\n        setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = '复制号码'; }, 1800);\n      };\n      if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {\n        navigator.clipboard.writeText(number).then(done).catch(function () {\n          btn.textContent = number;\n        });\n      } else {\n        btn.textContent = number;\n      }\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2292,"cache_read_input_tokens":31725,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2292},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,