\">\n            <div class=\"dept-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🛁</div>\n            <h3>美容与住院</h3>\n            <p>洗护美容、药浴，以及术后住院与寄养观察，24 小时专人照护。</p>\n            <div class=\"tags\"><span>洗护</span><span>药浴</span><span>住院</span></div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"doctors\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <h2>医生团队</h2>\n          <p>执业兽医师团队，耐心沟通，把每只宠物当作自家孩子。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-4\">\n          <article class=\"doctor\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">林</div>\n            <h3>林医生</h3>\n            <p class=\"role\">院长 · 内科主治</p>\n            <p class=\"bio\">从业 15 年，擅长猫科慢性肾病、糖尿病等慢性病管理。</p>\n            <p class=\"time\">出诊：周一至周五</p>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"doctor\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">陈</div>\n            <h3>陈医生</h3>\n            <p class=\"role\">外科主治</p>\n            <p class=\"bio\">擅长软组织手术与骨科手术，完成绝育手术逾三千例。</p>\n            <p class=\"time\">出诊：周二至周六</p>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"doctor\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">周</div>\n            <h3>周医生</h3>\n            <p class=\"role\">牙科 · 皮肤科</p>\n            <p class=\"bio\">专注宠物口腔与皮肤病，对过敏性皮炎有丰富经验。</p>\n            <p class=\"time\">出诊：周三至周日</p>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"doctor\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">许</div>\n            <h3>许医生</h3>\n            <p class=\"role\">影像 · 异宠</p>\n            <p class=\"bio\">负责 B 超与 X 光诊断，兼看兔子、仓鼠等小型异宠。</p>\n            <p class=\"time\">出诊：周末及节假日</p>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section alt\" id=\"booking\">\n      <div class=\"wrap booking\">\n        <div class=\"phone-card\">\n          <h2>预约电话</h2>\n          <p>提前预约可减少等候时间，急症请直接来院或来电。</p>\n          <a class=\"phone-number\" href=\"tel:01088886666\" id=\"phone\">010-8888-6666</a>\n          <p class=\"sub\">接听时间：每日 09:00 – 21:00（夜间急诊同号）</p>\n          <button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"copyBtn\">复制号码</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"steps\">\n          <h3>预约流程</h3>\n          <ol>\n            <li><strong>来电预约：</strong>告知宠物种类、年龄和主要症状。</li>\n            <li><strong>确认时间：</strong>前台为您安排合适的科室与医生。</li>\n            <li><strong>按时到院：</strong>请携带既往病历和疫苗本（如有）。</li>\n            <li><strong>就诊复查：</strong>医生会告知复诊时间，并电话回访。</li>\n          </ol>\n          <div class=\"address\">\n            📍 地址：幸福里社区 3 号楼底商（社区北门东侧 50 米）<br>\n            🚗 门前可临时停车，猫咪请装入航空箱，狗狗请牵好牵引绳。\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <span>© 2026 暖爪社区宠物医院</span>\n      <span>动物诊疗许可证号：（请填写）</span>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <div class=\"mobile-call\">\n    <a href=\"tel:01088886666\">📞 一键拨打预约电话</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    document.getElementById('copyBtn').addEventListener('click', function () {\n      var btn = this;\n      var number = document.getElementById('phone').textContent.trim();\n      var done = function () {\n        btn.textContent = '已复制 ✓';\n        setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = '复制号码'; }, 1800);\n      };\n      if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {\n        navigator.clipboard.writeText(number).then(done).catch(function () {\n          btn.textContent = number;\n        });\n      } else {\n        btn.textContent = number;\n      }\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}}
